<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 4.804 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 4.804 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 4.804 billion pesos in the secondary market on Thursday through four credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>1.268 bln  15 days</p>
<p>1.268 bln  13 days</p>
<p>1.268 bln  12 days</p>
<p>1.000 bln   1 day</p>
<p>Figures in pesos</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
